<title>PORTUGAL: Avge yld 6.26 pct on Portugal 10-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Avge yld 6.26 pct on Portugal 10-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Institute for Public Credit Management auction of 15 billion escudos of 10-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>    ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY:23/2/07</p>
<p>    AMOUNT PLACED: 12.9 billion escudos   COUPON:6.625</p>
<p>    AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.257713 pct</p>
<p>    HIGHEST ACCEPTED: 6.27  LOWEST: 6.23</p>
<p>    BIDS: 39.70 billion     PAYMENT FREQUENCY:Annual</p>
<p>    PAYMENT DATE: 21/7/97  </p>
<p>NOTES: The issue is fungible. The auction takes to 125.2 billion escudos the total amount of the bonds issued.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
